<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23502" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">injectus</span></b> , ūs, m.
		inicio, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a throwing</i> or <i>casting on</i>
			or <i>over.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">opprimere senem injectu multae vestis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					6, 50</span></i>
			;  so <i><span class="en">Plin. 8, 16, 21, § 54</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">8, 17, 21, §
			60</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pulveris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					11, 17, 18, § 58</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Stat. S. 4, 3, 22</span></i>.—
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>a putting in</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">animi in corpora,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					2, 740</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
